<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Dec qtr real s/adj retail sales fall 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>NZ Dec qtr real s/adj retail sales fall 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Monday released the following retail sales data for December and the December quarter (revised from figures are in brackets):</p>
<p>Seasonally adjusted quarter-on-quarter at March 1995 prices</p>
<p>    Dec qtr 1996	  Sept qtr 1996	   Dec qtr 1995</p>
<p>   -0.1 pct		 -0.4 pct (-0.3)	 0.0 pct</p>
<p>Actual sales change from qtr previous year:  </p>
<p>Actual sales change from qtr previous year:</p>
<p>    Dec yr 1996	    Sept yr 1996	   Dec yr 1995</p>
<p>    +2.5 pct		 +2.9 pct		 +2.0 pct</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:</p>
<p>    Dec 1996		 Nov 1996		 Dec 1995</p>
<p>    -1.1 pct		 -1.1 pct		 -1.4 pct</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    Dec 1996		  Nov 1996	     Dec 1995</p>
<p>    +1.6 pct		  +1.1 pct		+0.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
